Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪) 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.43,0:00:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)怎么了？璃绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.69,0:00:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)又感觉到什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)没……没事。没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《又是那个梦……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那到底是什么？》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)这里就是最后的遗迹……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第六张和第七张 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被放置的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，那里也是我们尚未遇见的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.03,0:00:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安七皇的传说所在之地。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)我们还没见过的巴利安……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.71,0:00:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)游马……快斗呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:00:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)啊……他说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.47,0:01:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么想调查的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)是米扎艾尔的事吗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)这次的冒险就这个阵容定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)你看 就能明白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的两处遗迹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}距离相当近。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)说不定是在同一个地方呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)总之 剩下的两张 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何都要拿到手！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.18,0:01:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲吧游马号 出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)那个叫金龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.79,0:01:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡精灵{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.31,0:01:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说你是人类？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.72,0:01:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我可不打算相信。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 高傲的异晶界战士……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能是低俗的人类！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)我也不打算相信。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)不过 我对剩下的遗迹很感兴趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)那里有的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该是纳修和梅拉格的传说。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)结果 你还是相信了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)不是这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.23,0:02:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想得到他们两人的线索。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.97,0:02:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要有他们在 七皇的力量就会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.24,0:02:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的 No.无论如何都要找出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)我说 星光……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界的那些家伙……他们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的是人类吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)从 No.中得到的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会有错。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)异晶界 说到底
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是像你这样的存在吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)如果把星光界和异晶界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}视为相同的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)为什么 他们会变成异晶界？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)他们的传说中共同拥有的某种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他们送进异晶界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.61,0:02:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}转生的也说不定。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟那帮家伙牵扯太深可是大忌。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）不把那些天真的感情丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又会被他们钻空子的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）我说啊鲨鱼……你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要跟异晶界战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）这还用问。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.07,0:03:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那帮家伙利用了我跟璃绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要让他们为此付出代价。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）可是不管是托隆还是费卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不都原谅他们了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）我并没有原谅。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是他们自己失去了斗志。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我也只是收手了而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光）不把感情带进决斗里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你的哲学吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）战斗的理由，始终是只为了自己就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我才当一匹独狼。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)喂！ 这里真的是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有遗迹的地方吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.53,0:05:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)坐标是对的。就是这里没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.19,0:05:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(???) 过来吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)喂 璃绪！ 璃绪 你怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)没……没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)总之 只能先从这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}撤退了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)等……等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}船的引擎好像停了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)也就是说 这艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不打算离开这里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(???) 过来吧…… 过来吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)谁？ 是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼唤我的人 是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 璃、璃绪？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 呃 怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟) 怎、怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(???) 过来… 来吧 过来…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 灯亮了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 刚才那到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪… 璃绪 璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 看显示器！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 璃绪？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 呃 那家伙怎么会在那种地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨、鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(???) 过来…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.17,0:06:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(???) 过来…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 璃绪！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟) 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马：鲨鱼 璃绪！》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马… 游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体) 游马 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快醒醒 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:08:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 啊 咦？ 鲨鱼 星光体？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 这 这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体) 不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在被卷入漩涡的时候也失去了意识。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 看来这里似乎是海底的 更深之处。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 什！ 天 天空中有海！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 而且 璃绪也
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来到了这个地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么啊…？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体) 这是 某种迷宫吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:08:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 这是老爸的硬币。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里面有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 璃绪有一种不可思议的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪在一直来到这里之前就感觉到了什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定就是被那股力量引导过来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.01,0:09:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 那股力量是指 No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(???) 过来吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 这是璃绪的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 不过 这个迷宫到底延伸到哪儿啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:10:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光) 看来就算胡乱前进
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也出不去啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 才不是什么胡乱前进。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迷宫这东西 不管
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.83,0:10:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多错综复杂 外侧的墙都只有一面。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从入口进去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要沿着墙壁一直走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天能出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔) 原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你来说倒是个不赖的主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.13,0:10:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 怎么样 可行吧 鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.98,0:10:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 不在！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哪呢 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇怪啊 进了迷宫明明没走多远{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却回不到入口了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔) 看来 这座迷宫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}常识是行不通的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 我们一直在同一个地方打转。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 骗人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔) 是真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我见过一次的东西就不会忘。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这面有伤痕的墙已经看过三次了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 那到入口为止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:10:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经消失了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:10:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Astral) 就是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.93,0:10:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然这样谁还受得了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别小看冒险家的儿子啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Astral) 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看前面。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 墙壁正在被造出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边也是？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊 这。这样下去根本出不去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Astral) 看来这座迷宫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何都要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阻挡我们的去路。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 那么 鲨鱼也……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(???) 过来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.06,0:11:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是在引诱我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(???) 过来 过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.80,0:12:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃、璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪 那是 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪) 我一直在等你。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 你是谁。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯) 吾名乃阿比斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) No.卡的精灵。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.07,0:12:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}操纵璃绪把我引出来的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾与汝乃是注定一战之命运。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}觉醒吧继承吾之力者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 虽然不知道你有什么目的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的对手就由我来当。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.59,0:12:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放开璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯)当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你能在决斗中将我击败的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:13:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 好啊。我就把你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打趴下，把璃绪夺回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 璃绪小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 请一定要平安无事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 啊 你是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.47,0:13:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝) 你们也
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来到了这里，也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 这里果然有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟) 编… No.卡什么的我不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都跳进海里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝) 海？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:14:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟) 究竟在海里发生了什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.87,0:14:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 上了。我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤大颚鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.43,0:14:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，当自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.97,0:14:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤鱼族怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将这家伙从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！鲨鱼·射手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级3的大颚鲨和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.66,0:14:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·射手叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.22,0:14:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.51,0:14:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自漆黑之暗现身的赤红之枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻第1回合不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.21,0:14:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯) 我的回合。抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤哥尔贡尼克·魔像。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 当名字带有哥尔贡尼克的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽被召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤哥尔贡尼克·石像鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧 凌牙。这就是我的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级3的哥尔贡尼克·魔像和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}石像鬼进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.61,0:15:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 哥尔贡尼克·守卫者！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 攻击力 1600。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 黑光枪兵的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.89,0:15:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力是 2100。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样可没法抗衡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯) 哼 真的会是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥尔贡尼克·守卫者的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1个叠放单元取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的怪兽无效1只怪兽的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将其攻击力变为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.45,0:16:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 唔… 黑鳍枪兵…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯) 还没完。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.06,0:16:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈尔贡守护者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在场时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力为零的怪兽会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.42,0:16:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯) 戈尔贡守护者！ 直接攻击!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 将1张卡 盖伏 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯)就凭你这副样子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能把璃绪夺回来吗？ 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 什么？ 这光是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这… 这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这… 这里到底是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能!? 这副模样是… 为什么我会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么… 到底发生了什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.19,0:17:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多 到时间了。大家都在等着您呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王样！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王大人！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪) 大家都在赞颂伟大的王呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 我？王？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:17:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是怎么回事……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道这就是这座遗迹的记忆》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.47,0:18:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王 国王！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王 有敌人来袭！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 敌人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙就是……敌人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迎击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那正是侵略诸国{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.41,0:19:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不断掠夺与虐杀的疯狂之王！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 为什么贝库塔会……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凌牙： 我明明对那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是被让他给我看了幻觉吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙到底在盘算什么！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《如果以攻击表示召唤出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会因哥尔贡守护者的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽会再次被破坏》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:03.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《哥尔贡守护者的攻击力是1600。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放的是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力1600的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骷髅乌贼。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来下个回合，至少
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会受到伤害》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯) 我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以你是打算靠这个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来挡住哥尔贡守护者的攻击吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.61,0:20:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动场上的魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥尔贡咒符！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将场上盖放的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.49,0:20:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将怪兽变为表侧守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.17,0:20:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙) 糟了！骷髅章鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯) 哥尔贡守护者的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.63,0:20:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的1只怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.77,0:20:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 哥尔贡守护者的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:21:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的攻击力为零的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.47,0:21:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.11,0:21:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动装备魔法 超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡会成为怪兽超量的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升怪兽的阶级×200点。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.65,0:21:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥尔贡守护者 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 可恶！该怎么办才好啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.82,0:21:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.29,0:21:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.49,0:21:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝) 游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 为什么 你会 在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝) 我是追着你们来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能再让你把 No.卡交出去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 你是想在这里做个了断吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝) 你迟早是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.04,0:21:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须打倒的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.01,0:22:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样倒也不错。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马) 多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
